          <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#F7F9FA] p-6 border border-slate-200">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1F2A30]">Aftercare Tips</h2>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 list-disc pl-5">
              <li>Brush twice daily and clean under bridges with superfloss or an interdental brush.</li>
              <li>Avoid cracking walnuts, ice, or hard bones directly on ceramic teeth.</li>
              <li>Schedule regular 6-month check-ups to inspect gums around crowns and implants.</li>
            </ul>
